{"candidates":[{"content":"Introduce registered attack-defeater warrants: a warrant whose carriage targets an existing attack edge (carrier->target, warrant_id), not an artifact. Compute a monotone least-fixpoint over defeater edges alone: an attack edge is removed iff it is targeted by a defeater warrant whose carrier is not itself attacked by any surviving attack edge. This pre-pass is deterministic and polynomial (O(E+V) on the defeater subgraph). Then run the standard Dung grounded extension on the surviving attack graph. This expands refutation to include undercutting and rebuttal at the level of the warrant relation, gives a causal mechanism for suspending an edge rather than merely disliking a target, and cannot invalidate a committed root because no new attack edges are ever created.","typicality":0.8,"evidence_refs":[{"block":"09ffabcd92979168"},{"block":"1dd041117ca8c54a"},{"block":"0378275f89478d38"}],"neighbours":["SRC_001"]},{"content":"After the grounded fixpoint labels every node, materialize a DefenseWitness artifact for each accepted node x: one greedy polynomial set of accepted defenders that together attack all attackers of x. This is a deterministic post-pass over final labels and attack graph; because each witness is computed by a bounded greedy scan and there are at most n witnesses, total cost remains polynomial. The witness is a derived record, not an input to the fixpoint, so determinism and reinstatement-as-derived are untouched. The causal mechanism is explicit: acceptance is explained by a concrete, replayable defense set, making it possible to audit why a conjecture was accepted without changing the skeptical semantics.","typicality":0.7,"evidence_refs":[{"block":"0e806619395ec8f4"},{"block":"0c302d11d621778b"}],"neighbours":["SRC_001"]},{"content":"Keep the grounded labels as the single authority, but add a secondary deterministic diagnostic label `suspend_reason` for every undecided node, computed after the fixpoint from the already-known labels and graph: direct_attack if any attacker is accepted, mutual_attack if the node attacks an accepted node that also attacks it, otherwise insufficient_defense. Because this is a pure function of final labels and edges, determinism and polynomial cost (O(V+E)) are inherited, and the primary accepted/refuted/suspended semantics are unchanged. The causal mechanism is a local classification of why defense failed, which strengthens the extension by making suspension actionable without ever altering reinstatement or root validity.","typicality":0.5,"evidence_refs":[{"block":"0e806619395ec8f4"}],"neighbours":["SRC_001"]},{"content":"Encode support edges as bounded-depth generated auxiliary arguments rather than as primitive relations. For a support edge y => x, generate a bounded chain of auxiliary nodes z_0..z_k such that z_0 is attacked by every attacker of x, each z_i attacks all attackers of x, and z_i is supported by y; translate the support into standard attack edges. With k fixed, the graph grows by O(k*E) and the grounded extension remains deterministic and polynomial. This gives support a causal, Dung-native mechanism while keeping reinstatement a derived property of the same fixpoint, and auxiliary nodes are not committed roots, so no root validity is altered.","typicality":0.4,"evidence_refs":[{"block":"0c302d11d621778b"},{"block":"09ffabcd92979168"}],"neighbours":["SRC_001"]},{"content":"Enforce the closure rule already sketched for validity_node in `att` construction: every attacker of a warrant's validity_node also attacks the warrant's carriage edge (and hence the target artifact), and make carriage a first-class relation so attack edges carry warrant provenance. This strengthens the refutation route from 'attacker attacks artifact' to 'attacker attacks the warrant that makes the artifact a target', which is more causally precise and auditable. The construction remains a deterministic local closure over registered warrants (O(W+E) with W warrant count), so the grounded fixpoint's determinism and polynomial cost are untouched; reinstatement remains derived because labels are still a pure function of the resulting graph. Committed roots are unaffected because no new warrant is invented, only edges implied by existing warrants are materialized.","typicality":0.9,"evidence_refs":[{"block":"0974daebd1665965"},{"block":"0378275f89478d38"}],"neighbours":["SRC_001"]},{"content":"Add a 'standing residue' report: after the grounded extension, mark an undecided node as standing if it has no path of length <= k to an accepted defender, computed by a bounded BFS from the accepted set (O(V+E) for fixed k). This is an auxiliary, conservative 'permanently suspended' signal that does not enter the fixpoint, so determinism and polynomial cost hold. The causal mechanism is structural isolation from any accepted defense; it helps operators distinguish nodes that might become accepted after new evidence from those that are stuck under the current graph. It is deliberately atypical because it is a diagnostic overlay rather than a semantic expansion, and the bounded-depth parameter must be justified empirically.","typicality":0.3,"evidence_refs":[{"block":"0909868ae3d22218"},{"block":"09ffabcd92979168"}],"neighbours":["SRC_001"]}]}